    scoreboard objectives add jhin.q.count dummy

    # Champion Scoreboard | Leona
    scoreboard objectives add leona.passive dummy

    # Champion Scoreboard | Soraka
    scoreboard objectives add soraka.passive dummy

    # Champion Scoreboard | Garen
    scoreboard objectives add garen.e.duration dummy
    scoreboard objectives add garen.e.count dummy

    # Champion Scoreboard | Malphite
