    scoreboard objectives remove space.mana2

    scoreboard objectives remove pos_x1
    scoreboard objectives remove pos_y1
    scoreboard objectives remove pos_z1
    scoreboard objectives remove pos_x2
    scoreboard objectives remove pos_y2
    scoreboard objectives remove pos_z2

    scoreboard objectives remove rot.x

    scoreboard objectives remove attack_damage
    scoreboard objectives remove ability_power
    scoreboard objectives remove magic_resist
    scoreboard objectives remove armor
    scoreboard objectives remove shield.all
    scoreboard objectives remove shield.physical
